# dev-loop (collab-finder)

> **Load rule:** Formal SoT below. Domain routing: root `AGENTS.md`. Deep how-to: [docs/agent-playbook.md](../../docs/agent-playbook.md) **only if** a step is ambiguous.

```text
// Signature
EditLoop ≔ Read → Grep → Patch → Lint → Verify
CommitGate ≔ user asked "commit"  // else summarize only
VerifySoT ≔ AGENTS.md verify table  // ¬ pnpm lint · ¬ pnpm precommit

// Axioms
A1  Know path before shell that touches tree (Read/Grep); skip for git status/pwd
A2  Rename/API change → Grep all sites → one-pass patch
A3  Minimal diff; match existing style; no whole-file rewrite
A4  ReadLints on touched paths after substantive edits
A5  Smallest VerifySoT row that proves the change; fail → fix → re-run
A6  Config edits (package.json, lockfile) still run type-check or gate
A7  CommitGate → status+diff parallel → stage task files only → why-focused message
```

| Phase | done_when |
|-------|-----------|
| Before edit | target paths known; callers grepped if symbol change |
| After edit | lints clean or N/A; verify cmd exit 0 |
| Commit | only if CommitGate; never secrets/.env/transcripts |
